WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:24.001
摄影师。
Photographer.

00:00:24.201 --> 00:00:27.501
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:32.001
:Luca：Harland把订婚仪式提前了。十分钟后。
:Luca: Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:32.201 --> 00:00:36.001
关掉车库的监控。谁也不许下来。
Kill the garage cameras. Nobody comes down.

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:40.163
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:45.063
你的气息。是它造成的。
Your scent. It did this.

00:00:45.263 --> 00:00:50.063
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:52.263 --> 00:00:55.063
原来你在这里。
There you are.

00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:57.725
你：和他一起上车
You: Get into the car with him

00:00:57.825 --> 00:01:00.125
上车。
Get in.

00:01:03.825 --> 00:01:09.125
你的气息现在留在我身上了。午夜前，酒店里的每一头狼都会闻到。
Your scent is on me now. Every wolf in that hotel will know it by midnight.

00:01:09.325 --> 00:01:12.625
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:01:12.987 --> 00:01:15.287
你：那“mate”到底是什么意思？全都告诉我。
You: So what does 'mate' actually mean? Tell me everything.

00:01:15.387 --> 00:01:20.187
一狼，一个Mate。只有一个。
One wolf, one Mate. Only one.

00:01:21.887 --> 00:01:26.187
高于任何誓言，任何律法。
Higher than any vow. Any law.

00:01:26.387 --> 00:01:28.187
:
:

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:32.849
你：一直给你打电话的是谁？是她吗？
You: Who keeps calling you? Is it her?

00:01:32.949 --> 00:01:34.749
Selene。没错。
Selene. Yes.

00:01:34.949 --> 00:01:37.749
她不重要。
She doesn't matter.

00:01:39.949 --> 00:01:44.749
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:44.949 --> 00:01:47.749
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:50.411
你：跟着他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room

00:01:50.511 --> 00:01:55.311
跟紧我。
Stay close to me.

00:01:57.011 --> 00:02:00.311
那是我的气息。在这里，到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:02:01.511 --> 00:02:05.311
你们的世界只在故事里讲述的存在。
Something your world only tells stories about.

00:02:05.673 --> 00:02:07.973
你：那是谁？你在等人吗？
You: Who's that? Were you expecting someone?

00:02:08.073 --> 00:02:12.873
我没有在等任何人。
I'm not expecting anyone.

00:02:13.073 --> 00:02:19.373
从我闻到你气息的那一刻起，我就离开了那场订婚。
I walked out on the engagement the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:19.573 --> 00:02:21.373
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:23.235 --> 00:02:25.535
你：把手按在他的背上
You: Press your hand to his back

00:02:25.635 --> 00:02:30.435
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:31.635 --> 00:02:35.935
:LucaArkwright小姐，他今晚不见任何人。:Selene他会见我的。
:LucaMiss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone tonight. :SeleneHe'll receive me.

00:02:36.135 --> 00:02:38.935
原来是真的。一个人类，Magnus？
So it's true. A human, Magnus?

00:02:40.797 --> 00:02:43.097
你：她说的满月是什么意思？看着我。
You: What did she mean by full moon? Look at me.

00:02:43.197 --> 00:02:46.497
看着我。长老会会在满月前带走人类。
Look at me. The Council takes humans before the full moon.

00:02:46.697 --> 00:02:47.997
我不会让他们得逞。
I won't let them.

00:02:49.697 --> 00:02:52.497
别怕。
Don't be afraid.

00:02:52.697 --> 00:02:57.997
:Luca Alpha，Harland已经召集了长老。
:Luca Alpha. Harland has called the elders.

00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:00.659
你：牵起他的手，跟他走
You: Take his hand and go with him

00:03:00.759 --> 00:03:03.059
带我一起走。
Take me with you.

00:03:03.259 --> 00:03:05.559
那就别放手。
Then don't let go.

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:15.559
今晚留在我身边。
Stay beside me tonight.

00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:18.221
你：我不害怕。我会留下，但不许再有秘密。
You: I'm not afraid. I'll stay, but no more secrets.

00:03:18.321 --> 00:03:23.121
不会再有秘密了。我保证。
No more secrets. I promise.

00:03:23.321 --> 00:03:28.621
我是狼，是我族血脉的Alpha。
I'm a wolf. Alpha of my blood.

00:03:28.821 --> 00:03:31.121
还要留下吗？
Still staying?

00:03:33.483 --> 00:03:35.783
你：接吧。但我要和你一起去。
You: Answer it. But I'm coming with you.

00:03:35.883 --> 00:03:40.683
接电话。然后跟我走。
Answer it. Then you come.

00:03:40.883 --> 00:03:44.683
:Harland：把那个人类带来。就今晚。
:Harland: Bring the human. Tonight.

00:03:44.883 --> 00:03:48.683
跟我走。很好。
Coming with me. Good.
